title: Many hands
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres showed you team jobs: be at your spot, wait for the call, do your part.
== lines
torres-zeke: Big one today. Takes four pairs of hands. Yours are one.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: Your spot's there. Brace when I say. Pass when I say. Easy.
torres-zeke: The trick is waiting. Everyone wants to help early. Don't.
? choice
* Wait for the call.   rel:torres-zeke+1 flavour:practical
  torres-zeke: That's the whole job. And not dropping things.   [laugh]
* (Find your spot)
  torres-zeke: Right. On my call, everyone.
